    "detailed_description": "Fumpers?<br />\r\nYour goal is to complete the track by jumping.<br />\r\nLet's See How Quick You Can Be at Doing This.<br />\r\nThe game tries to annoy you with annoying traps and the sound of the devil's laughter every time you die.<br />\r\nNo registration system, try not to die.<br />\r\nEach time you die, you will enter more experienced next time.<br />\r\nThe Slavic God Svarog Statue is watching you from the corner of the game.<br />\r\nTry to reach your house safely by jumping from the platforms.<br />\r\nThere is no rule that the shortcut will always be hard.<br />\r\nSvarog has moved some platforms for you and put some high bouncing nuts in some places, don't forget to evaluate.<br />\r\nDo not get angry and try to finish the game without closing it.",
